1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,835
I’m hard to love, Jao.

2
00:00:01,876 --> 00:00:03,545
[JAO] I’m ready to love you, Kara.

3
00:00:03,586 --> 00:00:05,046
[JAO] No matter what.

4
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:07,257
Sir Han, why are you being so nice to me?

5
00:00:07,298 --> 00:00:08,591
[KOREAN] I’m in love with you, Pearl.

6
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:11,010
I have been in love with you for the longest time.

7
00:00:11,052 --> 00:00:14,054
And it pains my heart that I can’t tell you.

8
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:16,057
I didn’t understand anything.

9
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:17,475
You’ve been here a long time, huh?

10
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,518
I think I might stay here for good.

11
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:21,645
The curse got you, too!

12
00:00:21,646 --> 00:00:23,690
You just don’t want to miss Kara.

13
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,649
Are you all set with your requirements?

14
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,651
Want to hear it?

15
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:30,195
This scholarship is not just an opportunity to study.

16
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:31,906
It's a chance for me to grow

17
00:00:31,948 --> 00:00:34,534
and to honor the people who supported me.

18
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:36,619
[JEREMY] I just wanted to talk to you because…

19
00:00:36,661 --> 00:00:38,037
I just wanted to check on you.

20
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,664
[JEREMY] You didn’t want to talk to me.

21
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:41,123
So, I wonder what changed your mind?

22
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:43,250
I finally decided that I wanted to move on.

23
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:46,337
Leaving you was the best decision I've ever made.

24
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:47,796
There’s something I’d like to discuss with you.

25
00:00:47,797 --> 00:00:50,091
I got recruited by an international NGO.

26
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:52,218
Kara, I’d like you to take over for me.

27
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,970
[KARA] Remember Noah’s mangrove project?

28
00:00:54,971 --> 00:00:56,388
- [JAO] Hm? - He wants to assign it to me.

29
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:57,806
- Wow, that’s amazing! - [KARA LAUGHS]

30
00:00:57,807 --> 00:00:59,726
[JAO] I’m sure you’ll do great, Kara.

31
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:04,564
[CAROL GRUNTS]

32
00:01:05,356 --> 00:01:06,566
[CAROL] Jeez...

33
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:09,778
- [CAROL] Busy day, huh? - Tell me about it.

34
00:01:10,195 --> 00:01:11,780
What are we waiting for?

35
00:01:11,821 --> 00:01:13,198
The go-signal.

36
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,741
It could come any time.

37
00:01:15,033 --> 00:01:16,242
Manifesting.

38
00:01:21,206 --> 00:01:23,792
- [CAROL] Let's deduct this because... - [PHONE RINGS]

39
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,460
Noah!

40
00:01:26,085 --> 00:01:28,296
- [CAROL] It's Noah! - [PHONE CONTINUES RINGING]

41
00:01:29,339 --> 00:01:30,465
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

42
00:01:30,507 --> 00:01:32,175
[PHONE CONTINUES RINGING]

43
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:34,552
Hello, Noah?

44
00:01:34,594 --> 00:01:35,762
Good news?

45
00:01:36,179 --> 00:01:37,347
[NOAH ON THE PHONE] It’s a go, Kara!

46
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:38,890
[NOAH ON THE PHONE] It's officially happening.

47
00:01:38,932 --> 00:01:39,932
No way?

48
00:01:39,933 --> 00:01:41,559
[NOAH ON THE PHONE] All thanks to you!

49
00:01:41,726 --> 00:01:43,311
[NOAH ON THE PHONE] Where are we celebrating?

50
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:45,313
I’ll let you know!

51
00:01:45,522 --> 00:01:46,815
Thanks!

52
00:01:48,441 --> 00:01:51,152
[CAROL SHRIEKS AND LAUGHS]

53
00:01:51,194 --> 00:01:52,570
[CAROL] Kara!

54
00:01:52,612 --> 00:01:53,988
So many blessings!

55
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:55,615
You deserve them so much!

56
00:01:55,657 --> 00:01:57,033
We’re celebrating, okay?

57
00:01:57,075 --> 00:01:59,661
Absolutely! And guess what?

58
00:01:59,869 --> 00:02:02,872
Jao’s boss approved his request to stay here, too.

59
00:02:03,581 --> 00:02:04,790
- See? - Right?

60
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:07,001
We really deserve to celebrate.

61
00:02:07,043 --> 00:02:09,003
[CAROL YELLS EXCITEDLY] Let’s go!

62
00:02:10,338 --> 00:02:11,548
[CAROL] You know...

63
00:02:12,173 --> 00:02:13,967
Isn’t the universe amazing?

64
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:18,221
- It always knows the perfect timing... - Don’t. You’re going to make me cry.

65
00:02:18,263 --> 00:02:19,763
Hmm... It's just that...

66
00:02:19,764 --> 00:02:21,682
- Remember when we first met? - [KARA] Yeah.

67
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:23,184
You were completely broken back then.

68
00:02:23,226 --> 00:02:26,645
But now, so many good things are going on for you.

69
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:28,647
It’s all because of you guys.

70
00:02:28,648 --> 00:02:30,482
- Oh. - [KARA] Especially you.

71
00:02:30,483 --> 00:02:32,902
The best caregiver, the best cook,

72
00:02:32,944 --> 00:02:34,320
the best at giving advice.

73
00:02:34,654 --> 00:02:36,864
- The best sister. - [CAROL SQUEALS]

74
00:02:36,865 --> 00:02:38,908
- Thanks, Carol. - I love you.

75
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:40,200
[KARA] Super thank you.

76
00:02:40,201 --> 00:02:42,411
You deserve it, okay?

77
00:02:42,412 --> 00:02:43,621
Enough drama.

78
00:02:43,872 --> 00:02:45,164
- Let’s celebrate. - Come on.

79
00:02:45,206 --> 00:02:47,624
- Your treat, of course. - I’ve got it covered.

80
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:48,835
Let’s go. Let's dance.

81
00:02:48,877 --> 00:02:51,169
- Call your kids. - Okay.

82
00:02:51,170 --> 00:02:52,796
Let’s go. GL?

83
00:02:52,797 --> 00:02:55,884
- [KARA] Let’s go! - [CAROL GIGGLING AND LAUGHING]

84
00:02:56,217 --> 00:03:00,680
[ALON BY JL]

85
00:04:18,132 --> 00:04:19,633
- [CAROL SQUEALS] - [PEARL] Isn’t it nice here, Mom?

86
00:04:19,634 --> 00:04:20,176
Of course.

87
00:04:20,218 --> 00:04:23,262
- We’re here to celebrate Kara. - Yes!

88
00:04:23,304 --> 00:04:24,681
They'll be here soon.

89
00:04:24,722 --> 00:04:26,599
[SIARGAONON] The food here is amazing!

90
00:04:26,641 --> 00:04:27,849
- Here? - Of course.

91
00:04:27,850 --> 00:04:29,476
You have favorites here, right?

92
00:04:29,477 --> 00:04:32,854
Yeah. For me, here, I love their sisig and kilaw.

93
00:04:32,855 --> 00:04:34,189
- Yes. - Really delicious!

94
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:36,359
- [CAROL] They better be! Oh! - [PEARL] We ordered kilaw.

95
00:04:36,401 --> 00:04:39,027
- Sir Noah! - Welcome, welcome!

96
00:04:39,028 --> 00:04:40,904
- [HAN BIN] Welcome! - [ARIEL] You're with everyone. Hello!

97
00:04:40,905 --> 00:04:43,116
- Glad you made it! - I wouldn't miss it.

98
00:04:43,157 --> 00:04:45,118
Of course. How many are you?

99
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:46,868
- Four? Oh, make that five. - Four.

100
00:04:46,869 --> 00:04:48,871
- Okay. Nice. - Let's go!

101
00:04:48,913 --> 00:04:50,707
[CAROL YELLS EXCITEDLY] Thank you!

102
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:52,583
[PEARL] Ariel, didn’t you...

103
00:04:52,625 --> 00:04:53,459
[WAITER] Sir, good evening.

104
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,878
[WAITER] I'm sorry, we have a private gathering tonight.

105
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,920
So we are closed.

106
00:04:56,921 --> 00:04:58,297
[FOREIGNER] Seriously? We came all the way here,

107
00:04:58,298 --> 00:04:59,298
now you’re telling us to leave?

108
00:04:59,632 --> 00:05:00,508
Sorry about that, sir.

109
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:01,634
[PEARL] I thought it was Tuesdays.

110
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:03,511
- [ARIEL] Nope. Thursdays. - [PEARL] Really?

111
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:04,137
[ARIEL] Yeah.

112
00:05:04,178 --> 00:05:05,179
- [ARIEL] It was Thursday. - [CAROL] Hold on.

113
00:05:07,682 --> 00:05:09,183
- [ARIEL] What is he... - [CAROL] Jobel!

114
00:05:10,018 --> 00:05:10,810
What’s going on?

115
00:05:10,811 --> 00:05:12,186
- Why are they here? - I’ll check on the food.

116
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:15,189
I didn’t want to let them in. They pushed past me.

117
00:05:15,231 --> 00:05:17,358
- [CAROL] What the heck? - [ARIEL] Han Bin oppa. I will show you…

118
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,109
Fine. Whatever!

119
00:05:19,110 --> 00:05:21,236
We’ve got plenty of room. Just let them stay.

120
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:22,155
[SIARGAONON] It's fine.

121
00:05:22,156 --> 00:05:23,406
- [ARIEL] Kilaw and sisig... - [CAROL] Jeez...

122
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:25,533
I’m really happy for you.

123
00:05:27,243 --> 00:05:29,245
I’m already so proud that...

124
00:05:29,996 --> 00:05:32,790
there’ll be more mangroves like Ruth on this island.

125
00:05:34,417 --> 00:05:37,420
I'm also glad you're here to celebrate with me.

126
00:05:38,796 --> 00:05:40,173
Thank you for staying.

127
00:05:41,758 --> 00:05:42,967
Always.

128
00:05:50,266 --> 00:05:52,267
[BACKGROUND CHATTER]

129
00:05:52,268 --> 00:05:53,310
[CAROL] Noah! Noah!

130
00:05:53,311 --> 00:05:55,730
[CAROL] Noah, do you want sisig?

131
00:05:55,772 --> 00:05:57,815
[CAROL] Are you all okay with sisig? No allergies?

132
00:05:58,149 --> 00:06:00,568
[CAROL] Okay. Kinilaw, too.

133
00:06:00,902 --> 00:06:01,986
Adobo, too.

134
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:03,571
That looks good.

135
00:06:04,238 --> 00:06:06,240
Nice. [PEARL LAUGHS]

136
00:06:06,491 --> 00:06:09,409
I think they’d like…

137
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:10,494
um...

138
00:06:10,495 --> 00:06:11,496
some juice.

139
00:06:11,537 --> 00:06:13,539
Maybe pineapple juice.

140
00:06:14,832 --> 00:06:17,126
Excuse me. Who are you?

141
00:06:17,418 --> 00:06:19,212
Hi, there. I’m Santi.

142
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:22,381
Okay.

143
00:06:22,423 --> 00:06:24,425
Come on. Don’t play hard to get.

144
00:06:25,093 --> 00:06:26,469
Excuse me?

145
00:06:27,178 --> 00:06:29,471
Out of all the Filipinas throwing themselves at me,

146
00:06:29,472 --> 00:06:31,474
you’re lucky I even gave you attention!

147
00:06:31,516 --> 00:06:32,516
I was looking...

148
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:33,810
- [CHAIR CLATTERS] - [CAROL] Hey!

149
00:06:33,851 --> 00:06:35,144
...to make you my wife!

150
00:06:35,269 --> 00:06:36,562
- But not anymore! - [PEOPLE GASP]

151
00:06:36,604 --> 00:06:38,564
- [SANTI] Huh? - [HAN BIN] Hey! Stop!

152
00:06:38,606 --> 00:06:40,107
Hey! What is...

153
00:06:40,108 --> 00:06:42,193
[PEOPLE YELLING]

154
00:06:42,235 --> 00:06:43,694
- [CAROL] Stop it! Stop it! - [GUESTS] Stop, stop, stop!

155
00:06:43,736 --> 00:06:44,445
[PEARL] Sir Han!

156
00:06:44,487 --> 00:07:14,100
[MUFFLED YELLING]

157
00:07:14,142 --> 00:07:16,269
[MUFFLED] Get out of my way!

158
00:07:31,784 --> 00:07:32,785
[JAO] Kara!

159
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:37,498
[YELLING CONTINUES]

160
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:39,583
- [ARIEL] Hey! Get out! - [CAROL] Stop this, everybody!

161
00:07:39,584 --> 00:07:40,501
[SANTI] What's your problem?

162
00:07:40,543 --> 00:07:41,877
Go home! Go home!

163
00:07:41,878 --> 00:07:43,171
[CAROL] Stop this! Hey!

164
00:07:46,674 --> 00:07:47,675
[MOTORCYCLE HORN HONKS]

165
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:53,681
[JAO] Watch where you’re going!

166
00:07:55,641 --> 00:07:56,642
Kara!

167
00:08:07,069 --> 00:08:09,696
- [ARIEL] Yes, take them away! - [CAROL] Take them to the barangay!

168
00:08:09,697 --> 00:08:10,698
[ARIEL] Get them out of here!

169
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,741
- [CAROL] Unbelievable. - [ARIEL] Don’t come back here, okay?

170
00:08:12,742 --> 00:08:14,452
[CAROL] Don’t come back! Leave us!

171
00:08:14,577 --> 00:08:18,372
These are the guys they’re always talking about on the Siargao Community page!

172
00:08:18,539 --> 00:08:20,541
I should post another complaint!

173
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:21,791
They can’t do that!

174
00:08:21,792 --> 00:08:24,294
They’re just visitors, yet they’re the ones causing trouble?

175
00:08:24,295 --> 00:08:25,129
Exactly!

176
00:08:25,171 --> 00:08:29,300
They should be banned here so they won’t cause any more trouble.

177
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,010
[CAROL] My God!

178
00:08:31,052 --> 00:08:32,428
Ariel…

179
00:08:33,304 --> 00:08:35,014
thank you.

180
00:08:35,598 --> 00:08:37,307
You were like a warrior princess there.

181
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:39,018
- [ARIEL] Please. - [CAROL ]It’s true.

182
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:42,271
For you and Mom, I’d fight anyone.

183
00:08:43,272 --> 00:08:45,982
But I wasn’t your only protector.

184
00:08:45,983 --> 00:08:47,734
I didn’t expect that to happen, actually.

185
00:08:47,735 --> 00:08:50,112
[WAITER] Actually, I’m sorry for what happened to you.

186
00:08:51,864 --> 00:08:53,157
Han Bin oppa.

187
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:10,548
[ARIEL] Look, those guys are notorious.

188
00:09:10,549 --> 00:09:12,468
They’re all over our community page.

189
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:13,511
[CAROL] All of them!

190
00:09:33,281 --> 00:09:34,365
[JAO] Kara?

191
00:09:39,787 --> 00:09:41,122
[KARA] How’s Pearl?

192
00:09:42,123 --> 00:09:43,165
[JAO] She’s okay.

193
00:09:50,172 --> 00:09:51,465
How about you?

194
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:59,682
I just didn’t expect it to affect me the way it did.

195
00:10:07,773 --> 00:10:09,191
I’m here to listen.

196
00:10:10,943 --> 00:10:12,611
[KARA SIGHS]

197
00:10:19,201 --> 00:10:21,620
Before I moved here,

198
00:10:21,954 --> 00:10:23,331
I felt so trapped.

199
00:10:26,459 --> 00:10:29,253
Jeremy and his parents...

200
00:10:32,006 --> 00:10:34,508
they made me feel like I had no choice.

201
00:10:38,512 --> 00:10:40,598
Like my feelings didn’t matter.

202
00:10:45,811 --> 00:10:49,398
Because of them, I lost all confidence in myself.

203
00:10:55,946 --> 00:10:57,156
It was…

204
00:10:58,574 --> 00:11:01,035
the darkest moment of my life.

205
00:11:08,334 --> 00:11:10,211
I thought I was okay.

206
00:11:14,215 --> 00:11:16,092
I thought I’d moved on.

207
00:11:18,511 --> 00:11:19,512
But…

208
00:11:21,806 --> 00:11:24,809
What happened back there brought everything back.

209
00:11:32,316 --> 00:11:33,567
Sir Han…

210
00:11:34,902 --> 00:11:36,904
thank you for earlier.

211
00:11:38,906 --> 00:11:40,282
You were so good.

212
00:11:41,367 --> 00:11:43,119
You look like a K-drama actor.

213
00:11:43,160 --> 00:11:45,203
[HAN BIN LAUGHS]

214
00:11:45,204 --> 00:11:47,123
It’s okay. No need to thank me.

215
00:11:47,706 --> 00:11:48,999
If it’s for you,

216
00:11:50,209 --> 00:11:51,961
I don’t mind getting hurt.

217
00:11:57,299 --> 00:11:58,758
- [HAN BIN GROANS] - Oh!

218
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:00,553
Sorry. I pressed too hard.

219
00:12:00,594 --> 00:12:02,972
[PEARL AND HAN BIN LAUGH]

220
00:12:36,255 --> 00:12:37,756
[HAN BIN EXHALES]

221
00:12:45,431 --> 00:12:46,599
[PEARL CLEARS THROAT]

222
00:12:51,145 --> 00:12:56,066
[PEARL AND HAN BIN LAUGH]

223
00:12:56,484 --> 00:12:57,485
Ow!

224
00:12:57,526 --> 00:12:59,945
- [PEARL LAUGHS] So... - [HAN BIN GROANS]

225
00:13:00,196 --> 00:13:02,198
[PEARL LAUGHS] Sorry!

226
00:13:03,949 --> 00:13:07,328
[PEARL AND HAN BIN LAUGH]

227
00:13:16,045 --> 00:13:17,963
But you're here now, Kara.

228
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:22,635
Look at how far you’ve come.

229
00:13:25,471 --> 00:13:28,974
You didn't let your past drown you out.

230
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:32,061
And you’re stronger now. Don’t forget that.

231
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:39,401
I just want you to know you’re not alone anymore.

232
00:13:41,987 --> 00:13:45,074
I know it's hard for you to trust people, but I’m here now.

233
00:13:45,950 --> 00:13:47,243
I’m here now.

234
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:51,288
I’m not going anywhere.

235
00:13:52,373 --> 00:13:54,250
You’re safe with me, Kara.

236
00:14:01,173 --> 00:14:03,175
Can you promise me one thing?

237
00:14:06,262 --> 00:14:07,763
Promise me that...

238
00:14:08,222 --> 00:14:10,224
even if you know I'll get angry,

239
00:14:10,516 --> 00:14:13,894
or hurt, you'll still tell me the truth.

240
00:14:16,981 --> 00:14:18,190
[JAO] I promise.

241
00:14:22,653 --> 00:14:24,488
And I also promise...

242
00:14:24,947 --> 00:14:26,949
that I'll never hurt you.

243
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:33,330
I love you, Kara.

244
00:16:31,031 --> 00:16:32,825
[JAO] Beautiful. Like a painting.

245
00:16:32,866 --> 00:16:34,952
This is better because it’s real.

246
00:16:34,993 --> 00:16:36,787
And it’s right in front of our eyes.

247
00:16:36,829 --> 00:16:38,621
This is the point of life.

248
00:16:38,622 --> 00:16:41,917
[KARA] Watching the sun rise with the person you love.

249
00:16:42,543 --> 00:16:43,918
- Good day, sir! - Hello.

250
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:45,253
- Checking in? - Yes.

251
00:16:45,254 --> 00:16:47,256
[PEARL] Let me guess. Korean.

252
00:16:47,297 --> 00:16:48,297
Very good guess.

253
00:16:48,298 --> 00:16:50,592
Yes, because the owner of this hotel,

254
00:16:50,634 --> 00:16:52,511
my boss, he’s Korean, too.

255
00:16:52,553 --> 00:16:54,555
[KOREAN] Stop it now.

256
00:16:54,972 --> 00:16:57,141
The guy you sent is trying to take me back!

257
00:16:57,266 --> 00:16:58,267
Sir Han!

258
00:16:58,308 --> 00:17:00,810
We have a Korean guest and he wants to meet you.

259
00:17:00,811 --> 00:17:01,520
I know.

260
00:17:01,562 --> 00:17:02,770
You’re expecting Sir Won?

261
00:17:02,771 --> 00:17:04,188
[HAN BIN] Whatever happens, Pearl,

262
00:17:04,189 --> 00:17:07,484
please know that everything that I’ve shown you was real.

263
00:17:07,693 --> 00:17:10,779
Did something happen? Do I need to know anything?

264
00:17:10,821 --> 00:17:12,573
There’s a lot of things I need to tell you,

265
00:17:12,614 --> 00:17:15,117
but I never found the right opportunity.
